ed synthesis surrounds the relaxed architecture operation with leading and trailing full fences, acquire synthesis applies a trailing acquire fence after the relaxed operation, and release synthesis applies a leading release fence before the relaxed operation."},{"kind":"invariant","sids":["include/linux/atomic/atomic-arch-fallback.h::raw_atomic_inc","include/linux/atomic/atomic-arch-fallback.h::raw_atomic_dec","include/linux/atomic/atomic-arch-fallback.h::raw_atomic_inc_return","include/linux/atomic/atomic-arch-fallback.h::raw_atomic_dec_return","include/linux/atomic/atomic-arch-fallback.h::raw_atomic_fetch_inc","include/linux/atomic/atomic-arch-fallback.h::raw_atomic_fetch_dec","include/linux/atomic/atomic-arch-fallback.h::raw_atomic_andnot","include/linux/atomic/atomic-arch-fallback.h::raw_atomic_fetch_andnot","include/linux/atomic/atomic-arch-fallback.h::raw_atomic_fetch_andnot_relaxed","include/linux/atomic/atomic-arch-fallback.h::raw_atomic_inc_return_relaxed","include/linux/atomic/atomic-arch-fallback.h::raw_atomic_dec_return_relaxed"],"text":"Derived operations reduce to more general forms when no dedicated architecture primitive exists, with increment expressed as unit addition, decrement as unit subtraction, fetch increment and decrement as unit fetch add and subtract, and masked clear expressed as conjunction with an inverted mask."},{"kind":"invariant","sids":["include/linux/atomic/atomic-arch-fallback.h::raw_atomic_xchg","include/linux/atomic/atomic-arch-fallback.h::raw_atomic_xchg_acquire","include/linux/atomic/atomic-arch-fallback.h::raw_atomic_xchg_release","include/linux/atomic/atomic-arch-fallback.h::raw_atomic_xchg_relaxed","include/linux/atomic/atomic-arch-fallback.h::raw_atomic_cmpxchg","include/linux/atomic/atomic-arch-fallback.h::raw_atomic_cmpxchg_release","include/linux/atomic/atomic-arch-fallback.h::raw_atomic_cmpxchg_relaxed","include/linux/atomic/atomic-arch-fallback.h::raw_atomic_try_cmpxchg","include/linux/atomic/atomic-arch-fallback.h: